  "content": "\n\n<p>Minecraft 有一个便捷功能，可以支持多语言模组。然而，本模组旨在解决以下几个问题。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1283747.svg\" alt=\"versions\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"neoforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"forge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a></p>\n<h2>情况一</h2>\n<p><strong>问题：</strong><br>\n作者发布了一个模组后，社区成员开始向作者提供其他语言的翻译。但由于某些原因，作者并未对模组进行修改。唯一的解决办法是手动将你的翻译添加到 jar 文件中，并期盼作者总有一天会认可该翻译。然而，一旦模组更新，你所有的努力都将被覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：</strong><br>\nPolyglot 模组允许你将翻译文件移至其他位置。它会在你的游戏目录根文件夹中创建一个文件夹，用于存放你的翻译文件。</p>\n<p>这样一来，你不再需要修改 jar 文件，也无需担心模组更新后翻译被覆盖。你的翻译完全独立于原模组。</p>\n<h2>情况二</h2>\n<p><strong>问题：</strong><br>\n出于某些原因，作者决定不使用专为文本翻译设计的功能，而是将文本硬编码在代码中，导致无法通过翻译文件进行翻译。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：</strong><br>\n目前，Polyglot 允许你翻译物品提示（tooltip）中的此类文本。你需要在翻译文件中添加一行如下格式的文本：</p>\n<h2>使用方法：</h2>\n<p>你可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludwici.github.io%252fpolyglot_wiki%252fabout.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>中找到相关指南。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>我的整合包：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblewatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kg0VTRKw/Untitled-125.jpg\" alt=\"cobblewatch\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我的其他模组：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"carpet-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"copper-deco\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"mob-loot-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"better-block-sounds-fork\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"slime-overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"weapon-mastery\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"bigwater\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-raid-den-icons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fywpGqft/cri.png\" alt=\"cobblemon-raid-den-icons\"></a></p>",
